description:
Replace the private image-building helpers in the core repository-state and document test modules with the shared test image builder.

## Background

- `jit::test_harness` offers a builder that closes a `RepositoryImage` over any declared entries, listings and pinned evidence, with a derived or caller-supplied capture spec and layout.
- Private closers in these test modules:
  - `crates/jit/src/repository_state/mod.rs`: `layout` (`:1237`), `image_with` (`:1434`) and the inline closes at `:1263,1325`;
  - `repository_state/mutation.rs`: `layout` (`:1394`), `image_with` (`:1435`) and the close at `:1789`;
  - `repository_state/archive.rs`: `image_with` (`:631-645`), over directories and pinned evidence;
  - `repository_state/materialize.rs`: `image` (`:707-727`) and `image_with_ignore` (`:1837`);
  - `repository_state/overlay.rs`: the test close at `:155-197`;
  - `document/reference.rs`: `image` (`:320-350`), over pinned evidence.
- `RepositoryImage`'s own tests in `repository_state/image.rs` test `close` itself, and `apply_overlay` (`overlay.rs:92`) and the storage capture close images in production; neither is a test helper.

## Success Criteria

- [hard] REQ-01: The listed test modules build images through the shared builder, and none of them closes a `RepositoryImage` through a helper or inline call of its own.
- [hard] REQ-02: Each rewritten test asserts the property it asserted before, and the repository-state and document suites pass.

## Notes

- Written against the code as it stands after the changes this one follows; line citations name current code.
